  # `stream.tty?`. `NO_COLOR` wins over `FORCE_COLOR` when both are set.
  #
  # `stream` is the IO the colorized text is destined for. CLI subcommands
  # that print to stdout should pass `$stdout` so a redirected pipe doesn't
  # get ANSI sequences.
